      "v": "maks",
      "t": "Да.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah.' A crisp, everyday conversational reply meaning 'yes' that you will hear constantly in Russian dialogue.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Это невозможно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is impossible.' This everyday Russian sentence pairs 'this' with 'impossible'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "maks",
      "t": "Я хороший повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
